63
00:02:28.550 --> 00:02:29.383
It's so great,

64
00:02:29.383 --> 00:02:31.320
and also can you please

65
00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:34.730
tell us about "Ma Rainey's Black Bottom" because,

66
00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:36.490
sorry, is that the title?

67
00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:37.637
Okay, great.
That's it.

68
00:02:37.637 --> 00:02:39.860
All of a sudden I panicked.

69
00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:41.740
