72
00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:51.900
It's Viola Davis, it's directed by George C. Wolfe.

73
00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:56.010
It is gonna come out to Netflix in the end of December.

74
00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:57.910
Can you tell us about it?

75
00:02:57.910 --> 00:02:59.720
Absolutely, "Ma Rainey's Black Bottom" is,

76
00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:04.720
it takes place on one hot afternoon with jazz musicians.

77
00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:08.540 line:15%
Ma Rainey's recording

78
00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:11.240 line:15%
in this session up in Chicago in 1920s.

79
00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:14.010 line:15%
And it's basically just trying to get through the day.

80
00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:16.560
And it's a wrestle about ideologies,

81
00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:18.940
