83
00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:22.013
It's passionate,

84
00:03:22.013 --> 00:03:23.670
it really tells a story of Ma Rainey

85
00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:27.879
who was one of the first openly gay jazz musicians,

86
00:03:27.879 --> 00:03:29.140
