89
00:03:33.410 --> 00:03:35.110
and we wrestle.

90
00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.250
Literally, we wrestle.

91
00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:37.150
We wrestle, we fight,

92
00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:39.620
